+    // Real Apple AIR (`metalfe` for `MTLLinkedFunctions.privateFunctions` / `[[visible]]`) can
+    // emit `declare ... @<name>.MTL_VISIBLE_FN_REF(...) section "air.externally_defined"` without
+    // a companion `!{!"air.visible_function_reference", ...}` node; map those stubs directly to
+    // `<name>` when not already mapped by metadata.
+    for line in module.lines() {
